<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Prairie Land Solutions | Land Services</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lato:wght@300;400;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --green:      #3a5a2e;
      --green-mid:  #4e7a40;
      --green-lt:   #e8f0e4;
      --tan:        #f5f0e8;
      --text:       #2c2c2c;
      --muted:      #6b6b6b;
      --border:     #d4c9b2;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Lato", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: #fff;
    }

    /* ── NAV ── */
    nav {
      background: var(--green);
      padding: 0 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 64px;
    }
    .nav-logo {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .nav-links a {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 2rem;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #fff; }

    /* ── HERO ── */
    .hero {
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(20,40,15,0.55), rgba(20,40,15,0.55)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500382017468-9049fed747ef?w=1600&q=85') center/cover no-repeat;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 6rem 2rem 5.5rem;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: #ffffff;
      opacity: 1;
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-family: "Lato", Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 300;
    }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* ── SECTIONS ── */
    section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
    .section-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h2 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", Georgia, serif;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      color: var(--green);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    p { line-height: 1.8; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text); }
    p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── SERVICES ── */
    .services { background: var(--tan); }
    .services-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .service-card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
    .card-icon {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .service-card h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--green);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .service-card p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── TAGLINE ── */
    .tagline {
      background: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .tagline p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--green);
      font-style: italic;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── AREAS ── */
    .areas { background: var(--tan); }
    .county-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .county-tag {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 2rem;
      padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    /* ── ABOUT ── */
    .about {
      background:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.93), rgba(255,255,255,0.93)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1625246333195-78d9c38ad449?w=1400&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    }

    /* ── CONTACT ── */
    .contact { background: var(--green-lt); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .contact-block {
      display: flex;
      gap: 3rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .contact-item { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .contact-item span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }
    .contact-item a { color: var(--green); text-decoration: none; }
    .contact-item a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    /* ── FOOTER ── */
    footer {
      background: var(--green);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-logo">Prairie Land Solutions</div>
  </nav>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Land Services<br>Done Right</h1>
    <p>Prairie Land Solutions helps clients navigate land access across northern Illinois, connecting them with landowners in a way that is clear, respectful, and straightforward.</p>
    <span class="hero-badge">Serving Northern Illinois</span>
  </div>

  <!-- TAGLINE -->
  <div class="tagline">
    <p>We make land agreements straightforward for everyone involved.</p>
    <p>We know that land is personal. Our job is to make sure every conversation is honest, every question gets answered, and every agreement works for the people signing it.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- SERVICES -->
  <section class="services" id="services">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="card-icon">📋</div>
          <h3>Easement Consultation</h3>
          <p>We help clients understand easement options and guide the process from first contact to signed agreement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🤝</div>
          <h3>Land Outreach</h3>
          <p>We support clients in reaching the right landowners, handling outreach professionally and respectfully.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="card-icon">🔍</div>
          <h3>Due Diligence Support</h3>
          <p>Parcel research, ownership verification, and coordination with title and legal teams.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="card-icon">📞</div>
          <h3>Landowner Liaison</h3>
          <p>We serve as a consistent point of contact throughout any land agreement process.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <p>Prairie Land Solutions is a land services firm focused on helping clients reach rural and agricultural landowners across northern Illinois. We specialize in outreach, coordination, and due diligence for projects that require working with landowners on their terms.</p>
      <p>Our approach is straightforward. We prioritize clear communication between our clients and the landowners they need to reach, making sure both sides understand what is being asked and why. We believe landowners deserve honest answers and a low-pressure process, and we make sure that is what they get.</p>
      <p>We work with a network of land professionals, attorneys, and surveyors to ensure every step of an agreement is handled correctly and fairly.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AREAS -->
  <section class="areas">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Areas We Serve</h2>
      <p>We work with landowners and clients across northern and central Illinois, including the following counties:</p>
      <div class="county-list">
        <span class="county-tag">Grundy County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Kendall County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Will County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">LaSalle County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Kankakee County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Livingston County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">DeKalb County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Bureau County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Putnam County</span>
        <span class="county-tag">Marshall County</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
      <p>If you've received a letter or call from us, or have questions about your property, we're happy to talk.</p>
      <div class="contact-block">
        <div class="contact-item">
          <span>Email</span>
          <a href="mailto:dylanmealey@prairielandsolutions.com">dylanmealey@prairielandsolutions.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="contact-item">
          <span>Phone</span>
          818-298-1840
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>
    &copy; 2026 Prairie Land Solutions &nbsp;|&nbsp; Land Services
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
